# Local/internal Kiro specs. Future specs stay ignored; the directories negated
# below are tracked as historical release-planning evidence and validator
# compatibility artifacts (see CONTRIBUTING.md, "Internal Specification Hygiene").
# Every negation here must correspond to a directory that is actually tracked,
# otherwise new files added there are silently discarded by `git add .`.
.kiro/specs/*
!.kiro/specs/agent-execution-control-handoff/
!.kiro/specs/conventional-commit-versioning/
!.kiro/specs/promptkit-sdlc-skill-adaptation/

# Better-PromptKit isolated worktrees
.worktrees/

